WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.019 --> 00:00:03.703
The raccoon stopped the car.

2
00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:07.394
"Well, why not?" he said.

3
00:00:07.395 --> 00:00:10.643
"I'll let you drive for a while."

4
00:00:10.644 --> 00:00:15.342
"Oh, thank you, sir!" said Toad.

5
00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:18.790
Toad jumped into the driver's seat.

6
00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:23.283
"Now turn the key," said the raccoon.

7
00:00:23.284 --> 00:00:26.605
"Vroom!" went the engine.

8
00:00:26.606 --> 00:00:31.416
Toad pretended he didn't know what to do.

9
00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:35.820
"Put your foot on the gas pedal," said the raccoon.

10
00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:39.427
"Now press it slowly."

11
00:00:39.428 --> 00:00:44.323
The car started down the road.

12
00:00:44.324 --> 00:00:47.670
"She did it!" said the chipmunk.

13
00:00:47.671 --> 00:00:50.347
"Imagine!" said the squirrel.

14
00:00:50.348 --> 00:00:53.514
"A washwoman is driving a car!"

15
00:00:53.515 --> 00:00:57.364
Toad went a little faster.

16
00:00:57.365 --> 00:01:02.318
Then he drove faster still.

17
00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:06.422
"Be careful, washwoman!" yelled the squirrel.

18
00:01:06.423 --> 00:01:09.821
The raccoon tried to take the wheel.

19
00:01:09.822 --> 00:01:13.302
Toad pushed him away.

20
00:01:13.303 --> 00:01:17.146
Toad sped up as fast as the car would go!

21
00:01:17.147 --> 00:01:21.073
"I am no washwoman!" shouted Toad.

22
00:01:21.074 --> 00:01:22.446
"I am Toad!

23
00:01:22.447 --> 00:01:25.598
I steal cars!

24
00:01:25.599 --> 00:01:27.352
I break out of prison!

25
00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:31.221
I am fearless!"

26
00:01:31.222 --> 00:01:35.931
The squirrel and the chipmunk screamed.

27
00:01:35.932 --> 00:01:39.119
"Grab him!" cried the raccoon.

28
00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.570
The chipmunk pulled at Toad's bonnet.

29
00:01:42.571 --> 00:01:46.329
"He stole our car!" shouted the squirrel.

30
00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.094
The raccoon tried to grab the wheel.

31
00:01:50.095 --> 00:01:54.136
"Get your hands off!" shouted Toad.

32
00:01:54.137 --> 00:01:57.410
They fought over the wheel.

33
00:01:57.411 --> 00:02:03.297
And the car sped crazily down the road.

